2026-07-26T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Initialized config with init.lua and module structure: core/options.lua, core/keymaps.lua, core/autocmds.lua, plugins/init.lua
2026-07-26T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Set <Space> as mapleader, \ as maplocalleader
2026-07-26T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Chose lazy.nvim as plugin manager with auto-bootstrap on first launch
2026-07-26T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Decision log format: ISO 8601 UTC timestamps in decisions.log
2026-07-26T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Chose fzf-lua (ibhagwan/fzf-lua) for file and buffer search over fzf.vim
2026-07-26T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Cmd+P/Cmd+Q approach abandoned — macOS/WezTerm interception made it unreliable; reverted to Ctrl+P (file search) and Ctrl+Q (buffer search)
2026-07-26T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Installed fzf 0.74.1 via Homebrew (system dependency for fzf-lua)
2026-07-26T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Enabled absolute and relative line numbers
2026-07-26T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Chose neo-tree.nvim (v3.x) for file tree over nvim-tree.lua — more feature-rich and actively maintained
2026-07-26T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Added <C-h>/<C-j>/<C-k>/<C-l> for window navigation — used to move between neo-tree and file buffers
2026-07-26T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Added gitsigns.nvim for gutter indicators (added/changed/deleted lines) and inline hunk diff preview via <leader>gd
2026-07-27T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Enabled inline git blame virtual text (300ms delay) and <leader>gb for full commit message float; PR details not available in gitsigns
2026-07-27T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Chose kanagawa.nvim (rebelot/kanagawa.nvim) as colorscheme; git hunk colors overridden with protanopia/deuteranopia-safe palette — added: #0072B2 (blue), changed: #E69F00 (orange), removed: #D55E00 (vermilion)
2026-07-27T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Fixed gitsigns hunk colors — kanagawa's colors.theme.all.git does not set gitsigns highlights; must use kanagawa overrides() to set GitSignsAdd/Change/Delete directly
2026-07-28T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Added lualine.nvim for statusline; shows branch name, * for uncommitted changes, ↑N for commits to push, ↓N for commits to pull via custom components
2026-07-28T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Chose toggleterm.nvim over snacks.nvim for coding agent integration — single-purpose, non-conflicting with existing setup; snacks.nvim rejected for being a kitchen-sink plugin that would overlap fzf-lua and gitsigns
2026-07-28T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Added named float terminals for Claude Code (<leader>ac), Codex (<leader>ax), OpenCode (<leader>ao); <leader>as sends visual selection to active agent terminal
2026-07-28T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Changed agent terminals from float to vertical split (40% screen width) so agents are visible alongside the file
2026-07-28T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Added <Esc><Esc> to exit terminal mode (<C-\><C-n>) — single Esc intentionally passes through to the agent
2026-07-28T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Rejected <C-[> and <C-]> for split resizing — <C-[> is equivalent to Escape in terminals; chose <C-,> (shrink) and <C-.> (grow) instead, step size changed to 1 column
2026-07-30T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Added <leader>gt to open neo-tree git status float showing only changed files
2026-07-30T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Fixed hunk preview diff colors — GitSignsAdd/Change/Delete only affect gutter; added GitSignsAddLn/DeleteLn for line backgrounds and GitSignsAddInline/DeleteInline/ChangeInline for word diffs
2026-07-30T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Neo-tree git status keybindings: ga=stage file, gu=unstage file, A=stage all; 'a' is reserved for new file/folder creation and cannot be used for staging
2026-07-26T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Rejected which-key.nvim for keybinding hints — visually jarring; using ? inside neo-tree instead
2026-07-30T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Claude Code terminal (<leader>ac) launches with --dangerously-skip-permissions — accepts blanket permission bypass in exchange for no prompts in the float
2026-07-31T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Added herdr-splits.nvim (lmilojevicc/herdr-splits.nvim @107273e) for unified navigation/resizing across Neovim splits and Herdr panes; herdr-side plugin already installed at the same commit
2026-07-31T00:00:00Z [DECISION] herdr-splits gated with cond = vim.env.HERDR_ENV == "1" — outside a Herdr session the plain <C-hjkl> window maps in core/keymaps.lua remain in effect; kept both rather than deleting the core maps
2026-07-31T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Called herdr-splits setup() with no opts — defaults already cover this config (neo-tree in ignored_filetypes, terminal in ignored_buftypes for toggleterm agent splits); nav <C-hjkl>, resize <M-hjkl>, at_edge/nav_at_edge wrap, unzoom_on_nav true
2026-07-31T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Created ~/.config/herdr/config.toml (did not exist) with the eight plugin_action keybinds for herdr-splits nav/resize; applied via herdr server reload-config
2026-07-31T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Created ~/.config/ghostty/config with macos-option-as-alt = true — Ghostty default sends composed chars for Option, so <M-hjkl> resize never reached Neovim/Herdr; tradeoff is losing Option+key composed characters
2026-07-31T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Kept <C-,>/<C-.> vertical resize maps — superseded by <M-h>/<M-l> in Herdr sessions but still the only resize keys outside one
2026-07-31T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Moved herdr and ghostty configs into the repo as herdr/ and ghostty/ alongside nvim/; ~/.config symlinks now point here
2026-07-31T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Herdr is symlinked at file granularity (~/.config/herdr/config.toml -> repo) not directory — the herdr config dir also holds runtime state (sockets, logs, session.json, installed plugin checkouts) that must not be version controlled; ghostty and nvim are directory symlinks since they hold config only
2026-07-31T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Not tracking herdr plugins.json — it carries absolute paths and install timestamps and is regenerated by `herdr plugin install`; the install command is documented in README.md instead
2026-07-31T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Added install.sh replacing the manual ln -s in README; idempotent, backs up any existing non-symlink target as <name>.backup.<timestamp>
2026-07-31T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Kept decisions.log at nvim/decisions.log rather than moving to repo root, though it now covers repo-wide decisions
2026-07-31T00:00:00Z [DECISION] Added brew install fzf and herdr to install.sh so dependencies are set up automatically alongside symlinks
